== ARCHIVE: local CI dry-run, matrix arm pyscf=2.12.1 ==

Second matrix arm of the same local CI dry-run described in the 2.14.0 file. Steps 2 and 3
of .github/workflows/ci.yml, full suite including -m slow, in-tree and then out-of-tree with
--pyargs, against pip install --target ~/cilibs/p212 of pyscf==2.12.1 plus this tree.

This is the version every archived number in this repository was produced under, so its
purpose here is not to discover new behaviour but to show the suite has not quietly become
version-exclusive: both arms of the CI matrix have to be green for the workflow to be worth
pushing.

